# The compositor config generator, split by concern.
#
# Singletons rather than instantiable types: these are pure text emitters with
# no state to hold, and a singleton is the shape that says so.
#
# ⚠️ NOT named Binds/Settings. config/Binds.qml is already a singleton by that
# name and tools/hypr.qml imports both directories — the clash is silent, and
# what you get is whichever import came last.
singleton Lua 1.0 Lua.qml
singleton EmitSettings 1.0 EmitSettings.qml
singleton EmitBinds 1.0 EmitBinds.qml
